flowchart TD
    E[Experience / External Artifact] --> C[Candidate Claim / Lesson]
    C --> V[Independent Validation]
    V -->|Insufficient| Q[Quarantine / Archive]
    V -->|Validated| K[Active Knowledge]
    K --> S[Cand. SOP]
    S --> ST[SOP Tests]
    ST -->|Pass| SA[Active SOP]
    SA --> SK[Candidate Skill]
    SK --> KT[Regression + Security Tests]
    KT -->|Pass| KA[Active Skill]
    K --> R[Revalidation / Expiry]
    SA --> R
    KA --> R
